<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Submit Report — NevCorp SOC Portal</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="navbar">
    <div class="brand">NevCorp <span class="dim">// Security Operations Center</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
      <a href="/reports">Incident Reports</a>
      <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2>Submit Incident Report</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--muted); font-size:13px;">
        Laporan ini akan direview oleh SOC Lead. Konten melewati security filter sebelum disimpan.
      </p>
      <% if (error) { %>
        <div class="alert-error"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/reports/new">
        <label>Judul</label>
        <input type="text" name="title" placeholder="contoh: Suspicious login attempt">

        <label>Deskripsi</label>
        <textarea name="description" placeholder="Jelaskan detail insiden..."></textarea>

        <button type="submit">Kirim Laporan</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>NevCorp SOC Portal &mdash; NevComp3.0 CTF</footer>
</body>
</html>
